1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,652
一下雪，北京就变成了北平，故宫就变成了紫禁城。
When it snows, Beijing becomes old Beiping — and the Forbidden City, the Purple Forbidden City.

2
00:00:04,652 --> 00:00:06,878
这句话，老北京人爱说。
Old Beijingers love that line.

3
00:00:06,878 --> 00:00:12,339
六百年前，永乐皇帝把它建成，二十四位皇帝在这儿看过雪。
Built in 1420 by the Yongle Emperor — 24 emperors watched snow fall here.

4
00:00:12,339 --> 00:00:17,194
红墙、金瓦、白雪——三种颜色，压着六百年的安静。
Red walls, golden tiles, white snow — three colors, six centuries of silence.

5
00:00:17,194 --> 00:00:23,667
赶明儿下雪，您呐，一定得来这儿站一会儿，听雪落在琉璃瓦上的声儿。
Next time it snows, come stand here a while — and listen to it fall on the glazed tiles.
